# Revise a Document in Progress

<img src="https://images.code.org/ef45b482f16ccd1f8a437f0c963f7c04-585015d9-e611-4704-b06e-83b52f8be36b.png" alt="Propmting tips and tricks. Ask follow-up questions. Be specific. Use feedback. Keep a critical eye and fact check." width="40%" style="border-radius:10px; float:right; margin: 0 0 10px 40px; border: 3px solid black;">

Let's try it it out! Review the prompting tips and tricks before you get started.

Identify a lesson plan, assignment, or email you are already working on in a tool that has AI integration such as Google Documents or Gmail.

Then, do the following:
* Use AI to suggest revisions, improvements, or clarifications.
* Compare the AI suggestions to your original version. 
* Decide what to keep, change, or ignore.

>#### **💬 Quick Reflection:** Did the AI improve clarity and quality, or just change wording?
